{"uid":"e93a6ff84bf4f27d","name":"test_the_explicit_s3_backend_is_probed_even_with_a_local_base_uri","fullName":"tests.test_readiness_probes#test_the_explicit_s3_backend_is_probed_even_with_a_local_base_uri","historyId":"db7936dba3f9974a04beac2295ee6952","time":{"start":1786413391425,"stop":1786413391427,"duration":2},"description":"L2: this is the shipped S3/MinIO topology, and it used to report ready.\n\n    ``base_uri`` is documented as *ignored* when the backend is ``s3``, so a real\n    deployment has ``backend=\"s3\"``, a bucket, and the default ``file://`` base URI.\n    Inferring the backend from the URI scheme classified that as local storage and\n    returned ``required=false, ready=null`` — readiness answered 200 while object\n    storage was unreachable.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>L2: this is the shipped S3/MinIO topology, and it used to report ready.</p>\n<pre><code>``base_uri`` is documented as *ignored* when the backend is ``s3``, so a real\ndeployment has ``backend=&quot;s3&quot;``, a bucket, and the default ``file://`` base URI.\nInferring the backend from the URI scheme classified that as local storage and\nreturned ``required=false, ready=null`` — readiness answered 200 while object\nstorage was unreachable.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1786412792640,"stop":1786412792641,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_reset_pricing_source","time":{"start":1786413391423,"stop":1786413391423,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_reset_tracer_singleton","time":{"start":178641